@startuml
!include style.puml
title Implemented factory spawn and observer notification
participant ArenaRun as Run
participant EnemySpawner as Spawner
participant "selected GameObjectFamilyFactory" as Family
participant World
participant EventBus as Bus
participant EventLogObserver as Log
Run -> Spawner : spawn(world, request)
Spawner -> Spawner : createObject(request)
Spawner -> Family : createEnemy(request)
Family -> Family : validate configured category size
Family --> Spawner : ForestEnemy or SpaceEnemy
Spawner -> Spawner : validate returned category and family
Spawner -> World : enqueueAdd(enemy)
World -> World : validate bounds/capacity/unregistered identity\nassign ID and queue object
Spawner --> Run : pending Enemy
Run -> Run : create HUD and optional log observers
Run -> World : commitChanges(0)
World -> World : activate queued entities in ID order
World -> Bus : publish(EntitySpawned)
Bus -> Log : typed spawn callback
Run -> Run : assign Patrol / Chase / Flee through AiSystem
note over Spawner,Family
The creator subclass chooses the category.
The injected family factory chooses the coherent theme.
end note
@enduml
